Service stress::PL21_CityRegionChain
{
    pattern: '/stress/pl21';
    documentation: 'Three hops through ASSOCIATIONS declared inside a dependency -- city to country to sub-region to macro-region -- alongside a one-to-one to the country profile. Every edge here is an Association with a mapped end, which nine previously linked projects between them do not have one of. One city has no time zone and one country has no profile, so both to-ones land on nothing without the chain itself breaking.';
