Service stress::DSLocal_BenchmarkTransitionItem
{
    pattern: '/stress/dslocal_benchmarktransitionitem';
    documentation: 'A filter, a computed column, a composite sort and a limit stacked on benchmarkreform::BenchmarkTransitionItem -- which cannot navigate anywhere, because its ends are inherited and F49 makes those unnavigable from a subtype\'s set. Depth being unavailable is not a reason to leave the query bare. Generated by scripts/corpus/deepstack.py.';
